    render();
  }
  if (chunk.nextOffset >= chunk.totalSize) break;
  offset = chunk.nextOffset;
}
```
Yes, each chunk triggers render, including the last one. Good.

Now, another subtle point: `onSelectAttempt` early-returns if the same attempt is already selected. That's a small optimization and avoids refetch. Good.

